.TH batten-perf 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-perf \- Measure this repository\*(Aqs own invocation cost
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten perf\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure this repository\*(Aqs own invocation cost
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
